{"id":2860,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为帮助研究生拓宽学术视野，深化产学研融合认知，全面提升科研实践能力，软件学院研究生会于2025年11月20日晚通过线上的方式成功举办了主题为 “学长领航”的研究生论坛。</p><p>本次论坛以“以实践探路，用科研筑梦”为主题，邀请在中国热带农业科学院橡胶研究所参与联合培养的李铭、李杨两位同学分享实践体验和经验。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xnN7J4oR-DM49Yo07W7nNM2Mz-4UNLaYLRnVUNQ2MmVRoR-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZL1yZn1ybU4lbnNnRL4A7o7n2LNQ2ol7bL8QkUlrVUlQFM7LDU8l8nRAFLz7an7CJv2bjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PMR7agtA8pUPcc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11410&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F828F9C59FDC38D8DF2FF9A93FBAEEAF/4C6CE4D8/110DF\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"520\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xnN7J4oR-DM49Yo07W7nNM2Mz-4UNLaYLRnVUNQ2MmVRoR-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZL1yZn1ybU4lbnNnRL4A7o7n2LNQ2ol7bL8QkUlrVUlQFM7LDU8l8nRAFLz7an7CJv2bjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PMR7agtA8pUPcc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11410&e=.png\"></p><p>李铭同学从橡胶所的发展历程切入，阐述了天然橡胶作为国家战略资源的重要价值，并且结合自身的点云研究方向，分享了在橡胶树品种培育中的数据采集等科研经历。李杨同学则聚焦“智赋橡胶”的跨界探索，介绍了其搭建蜂鸟物联网平台的技术实践，还分享了从测产取样等田间一线工作到台风灾情调研的亲身经历，最后还分享了他们的联培美好生活。讲解结束后，大家围绕科研、生活等问题积极交流，李铭、李杨两位同学结合自身经历逐一耐心解答，进一步扫清了同学们对该联培的认知疑惑。</p><p></p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xnz9JbnlMkMmfkL04GYUmLbLznVnR-asoRUDMznfn77PLRL0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhVUYhkLYysMNMfUm6Vn7liM7UDMNlPUmUZM4LPM4LDUzQFU4WkLRQRU4WFMRLZnmGJqjfjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PMR7agtA8pUPcc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11410&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DECB376CAB7EDE54D66E1B48731736A6/C2B06CC2/438F0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 428px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xnz9JbnlMkMmfkL04GYUmLbLznVnR-asoRUDMznfn77PLRL0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhVUYhkLYysMNMfUm6Vn7liM7UDMNlPUmUZM4LPM4LDUzQFU4WkLRQRU4WFMRLZnmGJqjfjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PMR7agtA8pUPcc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11410&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xUlMJfnNUPUNl8L08VVnm9DnlMVM4LaPozC8nRrRollDMlC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkysUYysoShkMRGDMm78LzC4MRUbnz7Pn7liL7V2nm7PoR6FnRTkolCZn7rFLmC8MzNJqjfjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PMR7agtA8pUPcc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11410&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/07C79B406614163449E11DE50AFF1187/D9B9F8DE/26459\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 425px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xUlMJfnNUPUNl8L08VVnm9DnlMVM4LaPozC8nRrRollDMlC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkysUYysoShkMRGDMm78LzC4MRUbnz7Pn7liL7V2nm7PoR6FnRTkolCZn7rFLmC8MzNJqjfjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PMR7agtA8pUPcc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11410&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次“学长领航”研究生线上论坛的举办，打破空间限制，为同学们提供了科研实践与联培经验交流的平台，让大家了解到软件专业参与农业领域联培的具体内容与工作模式，在科研方向选择、理论与实践结合方面获得参考。</p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://ss.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xnN7J4oR-DM49Yo07W7nNM2Mz-4UNLaYLRnVUNQ2MmVRoR-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZL1yZn1ybU4lbnNnRL4A7o7n2LNQ2ol7bL8QkUlrVUlQFM7LDU8l8nRAFLz7an7CJv2bjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PMR7agtA8pUPcc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11410&e=.png"}